From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: saiththerobo <the.tom.sharp@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 07:13:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: exynos: google: gs101-raven: describe the battery
 for the charger

The MAX77759 charger cell takes its float voltage and fast charge
current from the PMIC's monitored-battery. Without one it uses its
defaults, 4.3 V and 2.27 A: below the 4.45 V the battery is charged to
on the stock phone, and above the 0.3 C (1.47 A) the stock step-charging
table allows at 10-20 degC.

Add a simple-battery with the stock values: the capacity from
google,chg-battery-capacity (4905 mAh), the float voltage from
google,fv-max-uv (4.45 V, the top of google,chg-cv-limits), and as the
fast charge current the lowest google,chg-cc-limits entry from 10 to
46 degC, 0.3 C, rounded down to a charger selector (1466730 uA). This
is what gs201-cheetah does.

The bootloader leaves the charger at 4.35 V and 1.93 A (read on raven,
CHG_CNFG_04 0x23, CHG_CNFG_02 0x1d), so the battery stopped charging
short of full.

Tested on raven (7.3.0-rc6) with max77759_charger loaded with
default_ilim_ua=500000 temp_guard=1: the charger probed at 4450 mV and
1466730 uA from this node, and a wall charger still charged at 1.2-1.4 A
into the battery (the chip keeps choosing its own input current). The
guard read the gauge (band 20-42 C) and stopped charging within its 30 s
check when the gauge's reading went away. The phone loads it this way
at every boot since 2026-10-28.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: saiththerobo <the.tom.sharp@gmail.com>
---
 .../boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-raven.dts    | 20 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 20 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-raven.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-raven.dts
index 7d1de1105..1f4f95779 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-raven.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-raven.dts
@@ -28,6 +28,21 @@ chosen {
 		 */
 		bootargs = "console=tty0 panic=10 clk_ignore_unused rdinit=/init";
 	};
+
+	battery: battery {
+		compatible = "simple-battery";
+		/* google,chg-battery-capacity */
+		charge-full-design-microamp-hours = <4905000>;
+		/*
+		 * Charger limits without Google's step charging: the float
+		 * voltage is google,fv-max-uv, the top of google,chg-cv-limits
+		 * (4.2/4.3/4.45 V). The fast charge current is 0.3 C, the
+		 * lowest google,chg-cc-limits entry at any voltage tier from
+		 * 10 to 46 degC, rounded down to a charger selector (0x16).
+		 */
+		constant-charge-voltage-max-microvolt = <4450000>;
+		constant-charge-current-max-microamp = <1466730>;
+	};
 };
 
 &acpm_ipc {
@@ -277,3 +292,8 @@ ramoops@fd3ff000 {
 		pmsg-size = <0x200000>;
 	};
 };
+
+&pmic {
+	/* for the charger cell */
+	monitored-battery = <&battery>;
+};
